<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-white">
	<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
		<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12 text-gray-900">About Me</h2>
		<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
			<div>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					<span class="font-semibold text-blue-700">Senior Statistical Programmer at Merck</span> with extensive experience in clinical trial statistical programming, CDISC standards, and AI/LLM automation.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					Currently pursuing a <span class="font-semibold text-blue-700">PhD in Data Science</span> at Harrisburg University, focusing on cutting-edge applications of Large Language Models in automating clinical trial workflows.
				</p>
				<p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
					My research specializes in developing autonomous systems for statistical programming, reducing TLF (Tables, Listings, Figures) generation time from months to days through AI-driven automation.
				</p>
				<div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-6 rounded-r-lg">
					<p class="text-gray-800 font-medium mb-2">🎯 Research Focus:</p>
					<ul class="text-gray-700 space-y-2">
						<li>• AI/LLM applications in clinical trials</li>
						<li>• SAS & R code automation and debugging</li>
						<li>• CDISC ADaM data standards</li>
						<li>• Knowledge graphs for clinical data</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
